_oc=Adq64QuCbNev80AlmkMsGPWqRalG_gIw3_G7gkUumW3Vljid7Whh47U0AMw5EiN3U4k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEL3Io9tAWD4mb4PUthR1NvXVUnrd7yhln-Ws5XsmyhgQ&oe=6A7DC1E2"}, "display_name": "Transmission: Shortwave", "keywords": ["Music", "Retro", "Casual", "Driving", "British"], "long_description": "# Are you ready ... for BUSINESS?  Welcome to the Pal-Co Virtual Cyber Megaspace!\n\n\ud83d\udce6 **Deliver parcels as quickly or casually as you'd like in a 90s retro-futuristic Great Britain.** Cheers to the old new!\n\n{1603053214459105}\n\n\ud83c\udfa1 **Experience landscapes inspired by real-world areas across the UK.** Retro's coming home.\n\n{696112643145145}\n\n\ud83d\ude98**Customise your couriermobile!** Unlock different models, colours, and trims to make hundreds of possibilities.\n\n{856541900216686}\n\n\ud83c\udfa7 **Capture the musical magic of early EDM straight into your earlobes with custom soundtracks.** Gnarly!\n\n\u23f1\ufe0f **Simulate driving as much or little as you'd like!** Optional shifters, handbrakes, turn signals, and witty banter. \n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Are you ready for BUSINESS? You\u2019ve been chosen to undergo our state-of-the-art induction process. By becoming a ParcelPal franchisee, you can become your own boss by performing deliveries exclusively for ME! Percival Parse of ParcelPal PLC (a Pal-Co partnership). Ride the ParcelPal franchisee virtual cyber mega-highway through the most impressive display of 1990s technology in Great Britain. A life-changing experience is about to begin! Deliver your parcels and gain personal financial freedom!"}]}, "developer_name": "Cardboard Sword", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cardboardsword.co.uk/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cardboard Sword", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://transmissiongame.co.uk/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "